@prefix nmsc:  <https://w3id.org/nmsc/> .
@prefix sat:   <https://w3id.org/nmsc/satellite/> .
@prefix ins:   <https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/> .
@prefix var:   <https://w3id.org/nmsc/variable/> .
@prefix sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
@prefix ssn: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
@prefix ssn-system: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/systems/> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dct:   <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# ============================================================================
# GK 어휘 → W3C SOSA/SSN 정렬 — 생성물(src/gen_align.py). 손으로 고치지 말 것.
# 판정표 src/sosa_alignment.tsv 의 "확실" 행만 싣는다. 후보·안함과 그 이유는 판정표에 있다.
# 본 어휘를 바꾸지 않는다. SOSA 를 쓰지 않는 쪽은 이 파일을 올리지 않으면 된다.
# ============================================================================

<https://w3id.org/nmsc/alignment/sosa> a owl:Ontology ;
    dct:title "GK 어휘의 SOSA/SSN 정렬"@ko , "SOSA/SSN alignment of the GK vocabulary"@en ;
    dct:created "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:source <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> , <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> , <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/systems/> ;
    dct:license <https://www.kogl.or.kr/info/licenseType1.do> ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/nmsc/> , <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> ;
    rdfs:comment "SOSA·SSN 용어는 2026-11-11 w3.org/ns 에서 받은 원본과 대조했다(src/sosa_terms_2017.txt). 관련도·관측 한계·운용 기간·개발 분담은 SOSA/SSN 에 같은 뜻의 용어가 없어 본 어휘의 것을 그대로 쓴다."@ko , "The SOSA and SSN terms were checked against the originals retrieved from w3.org/ns on 2026-11-11 (src/sosa_terms_2017.txt). Relevance, observing limitations, operation periods and development responsibilities have no terms with the same meaning in SOSA/SSN, so this vocabulary's own terms are used as they are."@en .

# nmsc:Deployment subClassOf ssn:Deployment — ssn:Deployment "Describes the Deployment of one or more Systems for a particular purpose. Deployment may be done on a Platform." 우리 운용 노드는 위성 1기에 탑재체 1기를 실은 경우라 그 특수한 경우다. 기간·상태는 SSN 에 대응 속성이 없어 우리 속성으로 남긴다
nmsc:Deployment rdfs:subClassOf ssn:Deployment .

# nmsc:deploymentPlatform subPropertyOf ssn:deployedOnPlatform — "Relation between a Deployment and the Platform on which the Systems are deployed." 정의가 같다
nmsc:deploymentPlatform rdfs:subPropertyOf ssn:deployedOnPlatform .

# nmsc:deployedSystem subPropertyOf ssn:deployedSystem — "Relation between a Deployment and a deployed System." 정의가 같다
nmsc:deployedSystem rdfs:subPropertyOf ssn:deployedSystem .

# nmsc:carries subPropertyOf sosa:hosts — "Relation between a Platform and a Sensor, Actuator, Sampler, or Platform, hosted or mounted on it." 위성→탑재체. gen.py 의 온톨로지 주석이 3단계 대체 대상으로 적어 둔 것
nmsc:carries rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:hosts .

# nmsc:carriedBy subPropertyOf sosa:isHostedBy — sosa:hosts 의 역. 탑재체→위성
nmsc:carriedBy rdfs:subPropertyOf sosa:isHostedBy .

# scheme/satellite type sosa:Platform — "A Platform is an entity that hosts other entities, particularly Sensors…" 위성 4기는 개별 위성(개체)이다
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/satellite/coms> a sosa:Platform .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/satellite/gk-2a> a sosa:Platform .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/satellite/gk-2b> a sosa:Platform .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/satellite/gk-5> a sosa:Platform .

# scheme/instrument type sosa:Sensor — "Device … involved in, or implementing, a Procedure." 탑재체 13기 모두 OSCAR 관측 기기(영상기·분광계·자력계·입자검출기 등)이고 통신 탑재체는 스킴에 없다(2026-11-11 확인). v0.10 에서 묶음 KSEM(GK-2A 우주기상탑재체)이 더해져 14개 — NMSC GK2A Fact Sheets 가 "a suite of space weather monitoring instruments"라 하는 관측 장치 묶음이므로 같은 유형을 준다(2026-11-13)
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/mi> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/goci> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ami> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem-cm> a sosa:Sensor .
