<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/goci-ii> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/gems> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/gkmi> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem2-scrms> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem2-sosmag2> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem2-hepms> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem2-heems> a sosa:Sensor .
<https://w3id.org/nmsc/instrument/ksem> a sosa:Sensor .

